      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对三冠路线一定会碰上的强敌──\n美浦波旁，\n待兼诗歌剧绷紧了神经。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11bc39b7c0cb14852c8202f57fdd7005f419d480ed9d3b341764da1c90d76f68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
