    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03a555fe1ac963b18437d617",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同时，她的朋友优秀素质陷入了烦恼。\n一问之下才知道，\n她在烦恼东海帝王无法参加“菊花赏”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "87546d0f5f81ddacf2d1aa1a90ab3fc4613b464fa056d3080446218c82783b6b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
