      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼诗歌剧对这道疑问的回答是\n“只能用更精彩的表现拿下冠军，\n让大家都说不出话来。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "352b953004a8641d72efdf4640958e493317f78a41e86ed591d7836ece9dd270",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062401.json",
