    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d310fd89f1539accd72f4441",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼诗歌剧在努力\n为“日本德比”锻炼体能时，\n碰巧听见了米浴对美浦波旁怀抱的憧憬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3554e089faf755c3b312f8e1fe6985c82eb5dde418cb1a6cb217e88cfa38e5c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1a327b1346252eadb9c562e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f39b84eac21081995be7352",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同时，也有好几位想采访美浦波旁的记者\n造访学园。戴着圆框眼镜，\n看起来很沮丧的记者也在其中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "534888a34973f0fe610d28f48965c053e0084543be2b5884dedf22b9e3dcd969",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062402.json",
      "json_path": [
