    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb0ab47377b7fdd3097bff1f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“菊花赏”刚结束不久，\n便传出了美浦波旁\n将因伤进入长期休养的新闻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17adfe04c219695cf5273311f4b6129b0b2fa8f56a32972ead62b985da9a17d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
