      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe4e466cb611fa301c557807",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美浦波旁一脸愁容，不晓得自己\n何时能够复出。米浴也因为失去\n一直以来视作目标的背影，而感到不知所措。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e62adf9cff0787061ab3b8b8bd069811d07630d34d41bdc1063495c83283d5d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062403.json",
      "json_path": [
