      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "优秀素质表示自己\n至今已经好几次受到待兼诗歌剧激励，\n并表达对她的感谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3e5ecb2e429cfebaa4487ae2305a248a71aca3aa5414f366f66dd0b70f9f94b",
