      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的这番话，让待兼诗歌剧回想起\n之前秋川理事长说的\n“正是因为你才能带给他人向前的勇气”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd8a0bc5a8953bd87fdfe6aeed892c324c5f40f4b938d49ca61503a97c04a88b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
