    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2993298a9cf34bf745f571f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同样因为自己受伤而沮丧的美浦波旁，\n也从米浴努力奔跑的模样中\n得到了勇气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8852fec7e29768fb45436502cfc9fa880418bb3ce03f6143a4c6e27f084edfce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
