    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14008aa09dbf84acb8e77091",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这让待兼诗歌剧发现\n米浴就是为美浦波旁的心\n带来力量的“主角”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75fff2391fc91a859bc0e320b85fc72ec2a9b97b873057dff0b51555483f8a38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
