        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:304544bc4e7c4f3739e2acad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "闪亮、耀眼、她的背影",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef79bbead287a5ac679b4d59d2bfc0f3faaca97b7ece30bd46a43c8ca0fbf83f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f6d62086047e37256ec569a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待兼诗歌剧正在为“日本C”严格训练的\n某天，她收到了之前曾经采访过她，\n脸上戴着圆框眼镜的记者所寄来的信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "440b2ec89c0cfd35bf10ea7ec1ac0d924031d5fa70073239420e9d4048bafee9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c967a412f9d7d7fbda18b3a7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "信上写着记者好几次受到待兼诗歌剧鼓励，\n也提及如果待兼诗歌剧是特别的赛马娘，\n自己就不会从她身上得到这么大的勇气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bbf6ac367599990a1798ad9e547961e7fe7a67e7af4f7fca80ecfc716c12be9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f48875cb93de68030623cd13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后还感谢待兼诗歌剧成为\n自己心目中的“主角”。\n这封信让她理解到理事长当初说的──",
      "source_fingerprint": "06090b6a253dcb529a1a984da85d4c0cac5f3459dc8f84773476bfc7ec9c3ebd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e833a97dda858f4e4b617c3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“正是因为你才能带给他人向前的勇气”的意思。\n如果自己也能当上“主角”，她当然想当。\n也希望可以成为更多人心目中的“主角”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad1322c9678224fb7daedb3d5456d5e2840136aec228cb555946ff48ff41c550",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7dc2d625ea5bc90eec367dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这份新的梦想成了推动她的强大动力。\n她在记者会上立下宣言说自己将会成为“主角”，\n吸引了社会大众的期待目光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f06d568e32d16c332c079deaa052ded99d11b633439cb51afdf0b01a8ba25f68",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1062/storytimeline_501062405.json",
      "json_path": [
